          "In 1961 Ishkhanyan went looking for the man behind the story, and found him. Asking at Shikahogh, he learned that the man with the flayed head had been Gabriel Martirosi Harutyunyan, who died in 1944. He wrote to Gabriel's son Artem, and other villagers later confirmed the account.",
